# The release's sample data: ADMIN's first login changes its password;
# the loans and holds list the loans, the colour monitor in use with the
# 5150 and the two Ethernet cards reserved for the club; the 5150's form
# counts what is used with it, which its Loans tab lists after
# Ctrl-PgDn.
#@ SAMPLE
T ADMIN
K ENTER
T admin
K ENTER
T admin
K TAB
T Sample1986
K TAB
T Sample1986
K CTRL-S ENTER
K ALT-I
T O
S HOLDS
K ESC ALT-I
T I
K ENTER
S PC5150
K ALT-C A CPGDN
S USEDWITH
K ESC ESC ESC
K F3
T Y
